cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CERN-ParT: a Particle Transformer for CMS NanoAOD, streamed over HTTPS"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "dwan-ith"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dwan-ith/CERN-ParT"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
keywords:
  - particle transformer
  - jet tagging
  - CMS
  - NanoAOD
  - collider physics
  - masked modelling
abstract: >-
  A self-contained implementation of the Particle Transformer architecture
  (Qu et al., arXiv:2206.11833) that streams CMS NanoAOD collision events
  directly from CERN Open Data over plain HTTPS and trains on a single
  consumer GPU, with a leak-free masked-particle-modelling objective.
